# AREA HEADER

$area
au  Owl
ti  Eakos Canals
ls  70
us  85
le  45
ue  100
bv  0

# RECALL

$recall
rl  27347

# AREA SPECIALS

$special
xp  112
rm  {cA cold current rolls through the deep canals.{x
rs  notify/area/eakos_canals_reset.mp3
rv  55
mu  music/area/eakos_canals.mp3
mv  20


# MOBILES

$mob
vn  29200
nm  giant sea slug
sh  a giant sea slug
lo  <183>A giant sea slug is slithering about down here.<0>
de
A vast sea slug creeps across the ocean floor, its soft, rippling body leaving 
a glistening trail over the silt. Its mottled hide shifts between dull violet, 
grey and sickly green, and its fleshy horns sway blindly in the current as it 
feeds among the drowned stones.
~
lv  70
sx  neuter
al  0
act regenerator scavenger stay_area
aff slow swim infrared
bf  no_speech has_tail no_arms no_legs huge
mp  fight_prog 10
spit $n
~
ff  underwater
ff  underwater_ground

$mob
vn  29201
nm  marple fish
sh  a marple
lo  <196>A <202>b<208>r<214>i<220>g<226>h<190>t<154>l<118>y<82>-<46>c<47>o<48>l<49>o<48>u<47>r<46>e<47>d <51>a<87>n<123>d <159>c<195>h<201>e<207>e<213>r<219>f<225>u<189>l<153>-<117>l<81>o<45>o<39>k<33>i<27>n<21>g <93>f<129>i<165>s<201>h <207>s<213>w<219>i<225>m<189>s <153>a<117>b<81>o<45>u<39>t <33>m<27>e<21>r<57>r<93>i<129>l<165>y<0>.
de
A marple fish drifts through the deep water like a living lantern, its bright 
scales glowing in bands of pink, gold, and sea-green. It flicks its delicate 
fins with cheerful energy, scattering tiny sparks of light as it darts between 
the dark rocks below.
~
