sx  female
al  300
act stay_area wimpy
aff det_good infrared protection swim
bf  has_tail no_arms no_legs no_speech
mp  rand_prog 3
mpasound <69>A violent stream of bubbles catches your eye.<0>
~
mp  fight_prog 10
bubble $n
~

