$mob
vn  29203
nm  ingkludd misshapen shelled creature
sh  an ingkludd
lo  <225>A misshapen shelled creature crawls painfully about.<0>
de
An eyeless, misshapen, shelled creature lies half-buried in the silt of the 
ocean floor, its swollen body bulging awkwardly from a shell too small to 
contain it. It seems to barely move, save for a faint regular twitching at its 
pore-like breathing opening, but the moment anything disturbs it, the ingkludd 
erupts into a piercing, bubbling shriek that carries horribly through the dark 
water.
~
lv  71
sx  neuter
al  -95
act stay_area
aff slow swim protection blind battle_aura infrared
bf  no_speech no_eyes no_head
mp  rand_prog 3
mpasound <218>A piercing titter echoes through the deep water.<0>
~
mp  fight_prog 8
mpechoat $n <218>The ingkludd shrieks at you through its foul-looking breathing-hole!<0>
c sonic $n
~

$mob
vn  29204
nm  deepsea harpy
sh  a deepsea harpy
lo  <73>A deepsea harpy glides through the water, singing mournfully.<0>
de
A deepsea harpy hovers in the black water, her ragged fins spread like drowned 
wings and her pale, sharp face framed by drifting strands of hair. She moves 
with eerie grace above the ocean floor, taloned hands flexing as her thin, 
mournful song trembles through the crushing dark.
~
lv  72
sx  female
al  -290
act stay_area no_charm
aff swim fly infrared protection
bf  no_speech
mp  rand_prog 2
mpasound <37>A mournful song echoes through the deep.<0>
~
mp  fight_prog 8
if affspell($n) == 74
        break
else
        mpechoat $n {cA deepsea harpy sings a melody that strikes at the very core of your being.{x
	 c sonic $n
        c 'paralysis' $n
endif
~

$mob
vn  29205
nm  water giant
sh  a water giant
lo  <81>A towering water giant glides effortlessly through the depths.<0>
de
A towering water giant glides effortlessly through the depths, his smooth blue 
skin rippling like the ocean around it. Broad-shouldered and powerfully built, 
he carries a massive coral-forged trident, his calm, watchful gaze following 
every movement with quiet confidence.
~
lv  73
sx  male
al  -125
act stay_area
aff swim infrared battle_aura det_magic det_good
bf  huge
mp  fight_prog 8
if inrflag($n) ==  131072
        break
else
        mpechoat $n {CThe water giant summons an underwater blizzard!{x
        c glaciation $n
endif
~

$mob
vn  29206
nm  water giantess
sh  a water giantess
lo  <45>A svelte water giantess moves with effortless grace.<0>
de
A towering water giantess moves with effortless grace through the deep, her 
smooth turquoise skin shimmering faintly in the filtered light. Long strands of 
dark seaweed-like hair drift behind her as she bears a beautifully crafted water 
net, her calm but commanding presence making even the fiercest sea creatures 
give way.
~
lv  73
sx  female
al  -155
act stay_area
aff swim infrared battle_aura det_magic det_good
bf  huge
rnk elite
mp  fight_prog 8
c 'fury of nature' $n
~

$mob
vn  29207
nm  lorwyn merrow
sh  a Lorwyn merrow
lo  <80>A proud merrow watches you with bright, calculating eyes.<0>
de
This male Lorwyn merrow carries himself with polished dignity, every gesture 
calm, precise and faintly theatrical. His voice is smooth and persuasive, and 
he seems far more likely to defeat an enemy with argument, oath or clever 
bargain than with a blade.
~
lv  73
sx  male
al  0
act stay_area no_charm
aff swim det_hidden det_invis det_sneak infrared protection
bf  none
mp  fight_prog 5
if affspell($n) == 565
    break
else
    target arm
endif
~
mp  fight_prog 5
if affspell($n) == 566
    break
else
    target leg
endif
~
mp  rand_prog 1
say I have heard drowned bells with clearer arguments than yours.
~
mp  rand_prog 1
say Were wit a current, you would still be stranded.
~
mp  rand_prog 1
say You speak boldly for someone so poorly edited.
~
mp  rand_prog 1
say I admire your confidence; it survives all contact with reality.
~
mp  rand_prog 1
say Your mind has all the depth of an inland tidepool.
~
mp  rand_prog 1
say I would debate you, but it is ill sport to harvest only the lowest fruit.
~
mp  rand_prog 1
say I have met sea foam with firmer conviction.
~
mp  rand_prog 1
say Do all landfolk conflate volume with intelligence?
~
mp  rand_prog 1
say What a fine anchor you would make—heavy, dull, and a massive drag on everyone.
~
mp  rand_prog 1
say I’d tell you to get a backbone, but you’d just slither away.
~

$mob
vn  29208
nm  lorwyn merrow
sh  a Lorwyn merrow
lo  <86>A Lorwyn merrow glides nearby, her luminous scales glinting.<0>
de
This female Lorwyn merrow moves with courtly confidence, her colourful fins 
trailing like silk through the water. Her expression is warm but unreadable, 
and every word she speaks feels carefully chosen to flatter, challenge or 
quietly outmanoeuvre.
~
lv  73
sx  female
al  0
act stay_area no_charm
aff swim det_hidden det_invis det_sneak infrared protection
bf  none
mp  fight_prog 10
if affspell($n) == 277
        break
else
        mpechoat $n {cThe merrow ridicules you in brutal fashion.{x
        c 'ego whip' $n
endif
~
mp  rand_prog 1
say If wit were a currency, you’d be deep in debt.
~
mp  rand_prog 1
say How brave of you to bring that face underwater; most wreckage waits to be dragged down.
~
mp  rand_prog 1
say You move with all the grace of a dropped anchor.
~
mp  rand_prog 1
say Do stay. It is rare to meet someone who makes desolation look educated.
~
mp  rand_prog 1
say I would call you shallow, but even puddles resent such comparison.
~
mp  rand_prog 1
say I have seen pearls form around irritants less persistent than you.
~
mp  rand_prog 1
say You have a face one might trust with bad news, provided one wished it made worse.
~
mp  rand_prog 1
say You are proof that nature, when bored, might practise caricature.
~
mp  rand_prog 1
say Please speak again; I am collecting examples of courage untroubled by good judgment.
~
mp  rand_prog 1
say You wear ignorance with such polish that one almost forgets it is not jewellery.
~
mp  fight_prog 5
if affspell($n) == 558
    break
else
    mpechoat $n {cThe merrow smiles slyly, whilst wiggling her fins in a curious pattern.{x
    c confusion $n
endif
^
~

$mob
vn  29209
nm  deinosuchus crocodile
sh  a deinosuchus
lo  <22>A huge deinosuchus lurks here, displaying an armoured hide and massive jaws.<0>
de
The enormous crocodile-like deinosuchus stretches nearly ten metres from blunt 
snout to heavy tail, its dark, ridged hide plated like old stone. Its eyes sit 
cold and watchful above a mouth built for crushing bone, and every slow 
movement suggests terrible strength held in patient reserve. It swims through 
the deep, dark ocean, hunting for prey.  Today might be your unlucky day.
~
