sx  female
al  0
act stay_area regenerator
aff swim det_hidden det_sneak infrared battle_aura deter slow
bf  huge has_tail no_speech no_arms
rnk elite
mp  fight_prog 6
swallow $n
~
mp  greet_prog 10
mpkill $n
~
mp  entry_prog 5
mpkill $n
~

$mob
vn  29210
nm  deinosuchus crocodile
sh  a deinosuchus
lo  <22>A huge male deinosuchus lurks here, all brute strength and reptilian menace.<0>
de
This enormous male Deinosuchus stretches nearly ten metres from blunt snout to 
heavy tail, his dark, ridged hide plated like old river stone. His cold eyes 
watch from above a massive jaw built to crush bone, and every slow movement 
through the deep oceanic environ carries the weight of a patient, primeval 
predator.  Whelp.
~
