$mob
vn  29213
nm  deep scion
sh  a deep scion
lo  <64>A deep scion is here, all fangs, scales, and hateful intelligence.<0>
de
In its piscine form, the deep scion reveals what the sea has truly made of it: 
a powerful humanoid shape twisted with fish-like features, lamprey jaws, raking 
claws, and the cold stare of something that no longer belongs to land. You're 
told it moves with awkward heaviness out of water, but here in the depths it 
becomes swift, predatory, and horribly at home.
~
lv  75
sx  male
al  -1000
act stay_area
aff swim infrared det_evil det_good protection
bf  no_corpse
mp  fight_prog 9
c 'synaptic blast' $n
~
mp  death_prog 100
mpecho <64>As life fades from the deep scion, he returns to his human shape.<0>
mpoload 29216




~

$mob
vn  29214
nm  deep scion female
sh  a deep scion
lo  <64>A female deep scion is here, all slick scales and lamprey jaws.<0>
de
In her piscine form, the deep scion reveals what the sea has made of her: a 
powerful womanly shape twisted into something fish-like, predatory, and wrong. 
Slick scales cover her body, claws rake from her hands, and her lamprey-like 
jaws open with a hunger that no longer seems human. She still carries faint 
traces of the woman she once was, but only enough to make the transformation 
feel like a cruel memory wearing a monster’s skin.
~
lv  75
sx  female
al  -1000
