$mob
vn  29225
nm  ashiera
sh  an ashiera
lo  <74>A stocky ashiera glides here, grey-blue ridges sweeping from his brow.<0>
de
This aquatic humanoid is short and powerful, with grey skin, small ears and 
nose, gills at the neck, and webbed fingers moving with restless precision 
through the deep water. Ridged blue-grey folds sweep back from his brow, while 
a faint chill gathers around his fingertips, hinting at the coldfire and 
fog-wrapped magic of his wild-blooded race.
~
lv  80
sx  male
al  -120
act stay_area
aff swim fly
bf  none
mp  fight_prog 8
if inrflag($n) ==  131072
        break
else
        mpechoat $n {CThe ashiera's fingertips burn bright blue!{x
        c glaciation $n
endif
~
mp  fight_prog 7
if affspell ($n) == 21
    break
endif
if isnpc($n)
or subclass($n) != 12
    c 'chill touch' $n
endif
~

