<39>of the Pavilion gates can be seen in the distance to the north. You may travel 
<45>north, towards the Pavilion end of the bridge, or you can swim upwards, directly 
into the huge, looming area of dark water above your head.  Huge steel grates
prevent movement west and south, towards the open ocean.

A large <21>SIGN<45> has been fastened to the Commander's Pavilion gates.<0>
~
