$room
vn  29362
nm  A Wide Shaft
de
<144>A wide vertical shaft descends from the canal system through old, wet stone, its 
<145>walls slick with mineral slime and luminous salt. Above, an entrance is almost 
<146>invisible once the seaweed closes it over, leaving only a narrow seam where the 
<147>very dim light of the network leaks through. Below you, the shaft drops towards 
<153>cleaner, colder water, from which carries the distant sound of a deep swooshing.<0>
~
