<147>in quiet wonder as each faint wash of current sends glittering mosaics of light 
<153>sliding over the treasure pile, as if the moon itself were casting its gentle 
beams down here, deep beneath the sea's surface.

A patch of ground here looks to have been recently disturbed.<0>
